# Storms of Fate (jeuno 86): the available check's mission operands, one at a time (GM steps between walks into Ru'Lude
# Gardens' trigger area 1). A level 75 Warrior with Dawn's Status 8. CoP When Angels Fall current (828, under Dawn's
# 840): no section; The Last Verse (850, over it): no section; Dawn current, Status 7: no section; Status 9: no section;
# Status 8: 142, finished with option 2 (not 1: the mustZone set). Each "no section" walk plays nothing: Dawn's own
# area-1 handler wants Status 4, When Angels Fall and The Last Verse have none in Ru'Lude Gardens. Then the trade while
# the quest is only available: out to Misareaux Coast (the mustZone cleared: the available check holds again), a Bird
# Feather to _0p2: no onTrade in any of the quest's states (and none in _0p2's script): nothing.
lists RuludeGardens/onTriggerAreaEnter/1 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/142 MisareauxCoast/_0p2/onTrade
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=4,2.5,100 job=WAR lvl=75
mission Cop WhenAngelsFall current
charvar Mission[6][840]Status 8
item BirdFeather
login
tick 3000                               # the zone-in lock (2.5 s) keeps trigger areas off
walk 4,2.5,60                           # CoP When Angels Fall (828): no section; nothing
walk 4,2.5,100
mission Cop WhenAngelsFall completed     # a GM: the log's current mission cleared (addMission refuses to overwrite one)
mission Cop TheLastVerse current        # a GM
walk 4,2.5,60                           # CoP The Last Verse (850): no section; nothing
walk 4,2.5,100
mission Cop TheLastVerse completed      # a GM
mission Cop Dawn current                # a GM
charvar Mission[6][840]Status 7         # a GM
walk 4,2.5,60                           # Dawn, Status 7: no section; nothing
walk 4,2.5,100
charvar Mission[6][840]Status 9         # a GM
walk 4,2.5,60                           # Status 9: no section; nothing
walk 4,2.5,100
charvar Mission[6][840]Status 8         # a GM
walk 4,2.5,60                           # Status 8: 142
finish option=2                         # not 1: the mustZone set
warp -258.5,-32.7,280 MisareauxCoast    # another zone: the mustZone cleared, available again
trade _0p2 BirdFeather x1               # available: no onTrade: nothing
